@startuml
title Production release (Stage 5)

actor Human
participant GitHub
participant "deploy script" as Dep
participant "frontier release-check" as RC
participant Compose

Human -> GitHub : merge PR dev to main
GitHub -> Dep : checkout main (runner or operator)
Dep -> RC : this commit may go to production
RC --> Dep : ok or fail
Dep -> Compose : backup, up, health
Compose --> Dep : fail -> rollback
@enduml
